      "text": "1 sat/vbyte (virtual byte) = ? sat/kw (kilo weight)\n\n1 vbyte = 4 weight units (WU)\n1 kw = 1,000 wu\n\n1 kw = 250 vbytes\n\nou \n\n1 sat/vbyte = 250 sat/kw\n\nou\n\n1 sat/kw = 0,004 sat/vbyte",
